theorem diag_single_diag (u v : Fin n → ℂ) (r s : Fin n) (c : ℂ) :
    diagonal u * single r s c * diagonal v = single r s (u r * c * v s) := by
  ext i k
  rw [mul_diagonal, diagonal_mul, single_apply, single_apply]
  split_ifs with h
  · obtain ⟨rfl, rfl⟩ := h
    ring
  · simp

/- English proof (translation)
Replace the relevant objects with their definitions. Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules. Supply the required witnesses or components.

Chain the equalities or inequalities of the calculation. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules. A detailed English derivation is pending.
